WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.867
Book a visit, a call back or a task for a customer.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:08.667
Find the customer. Search by name, phone or street.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:19.800
A new caller?. New customer: name, phones, address (the zip fills the town), CSR and salesperson on one screen, and "Book the first appointment now".

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.067
Open the customer. Click the customer to open them.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:29.933
Book it from the customer. Appointment: their name, phone and address come with it.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:38.900
Visit, phone call or task. A visit has a time and a place, a phone call shows the number to call, a task is any to-do.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.967
When. The day, and a time from / to, or leave it at Any time.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:50.200
Who goes. Only the people who take appointments are listed (set on Team & crews).

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:58.233
Save it. Book it puts it on their My day and on their phone. The tour doesn't save anything: press it yourself when it's real.

00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:04.333
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
